<title>FRANCE: France to sell 300 to 500 mln Ecu bonds Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 300 to 500 mln Ecu bonds Thursday.</headline>
<text>
<p>PARIS, Sept 10, Reuter - France is to offer between 300 and 500 million Ecu of government bonds at its next scheduled auction on September 12, the Treasury said.</p>
<p>It said the 5.00 percent March 1999 bond and the 7.00 percent April 2006 bond would be on offer.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
